# Data Dictionary: College Rankings Dataset

| Column Name         | Type    | Description                                      | Source                      | Notes                       |
|---------------------|---------|--------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------|-----------------------------|
| Rank                | int     | Current year rank of the university              | College Raptor              | Lower rank = better         |
| School Name         | string  | Full name of the institution                     | College Raptor              | Standardized text           |
| Prior Rank          | int     | Last year’s rank                                 | College Raptor              | For comparing rank changes  |
| Scaled Score        | string  | Score + % change                                 | College Raptor              | Needs cleaning              |
| Prior Scaled Score  | float   | Previous year’s scaled score                     | College Raptor              | Numeric format              |

